mp": 1785079197, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "jsluiss_ibz", "author_id": "44982915883", "id": "17869079826632905", "text": "Ese no se parece al oculus de los videos de Fede vigevani ?", "timestamp": 1785069737, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "lasfloresdel", "author_id": "6995375457", "id": "18081305678252574", "text": "41", "timestamp": 1785040568, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "javipunk", "author_id": "1315933419", "id": "18601557643048419", "text": "Das demasiadas vueltas, el contenido es bueno pero te pasas cebando", "timestamp": 1784797367, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "oussama_07kl", "author_id": "36607260440", "id": "17886290271433966", "text": "Si sabes todo esto mi pregunta es , tú eres rico con todo este conocimiento?", "timestamp": 1784676349, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "robertoalejandro692", "author_id": "47948800699", "id": "17958962829157151", "text": "Y porque no lo haces tu ?", "timestamp": 1784658418, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "eduardo_sleit", "author_id": "73744753743", "id": "18060948260576766", "text": "Si fuera verdad todo serían ricos", "timestamp": 1784562245, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kvinnnnn_15", "author_id": "58361055359", "id": "18059411549766225", "text": "ya eres rico?", "timestamp": 1784233698, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DX_xwRxCr7l/?stkn=MXJ2YWU5dG03dmZ5dg==", "webpage_url_basename": "DX_xwRxCr7l", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/686488202_17867668128673861_5786593996627726542_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ig_cache_key=Mzg5MTA0NzQyNDk2MTcyNDEzMzE3ODY3NjY4MTI1NjczODYx.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=FEitRgPvIFMQ7kNvwHT6k1b&_nc_oc=Adp9oB0fY3KN28aiRC_x__axWUrPLbctDVEfIrD5ZK_H4f5WoTp_diD3hROa19ctRSQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=